      "Fluid Dynamics, Pressure Drops & Friction Losses: Analyzes laminar/turbulent flow via Reynolds number $Re = \\frac{\\rho v D}{\\mu}$ and Darcy friction head loss $h_f = \\frac{f L v^2}{2 g D}$.",
      "Failure Criteria, Fatigue & Creep Resistance: Analyzes Von Mises yield criteria $\\sigma_v \\le \\sigma_y$, fatigue endurance limits, and high-temperature creep deformation in Fundamentals.",
